      "Title": "Synopsis",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for libpng is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "The libpng package contains libraries used by other programs for reading and writing PNG format files. The PNG format was designed as a replacement for GIF and, to a lesser extent, TIFF, with many improvements and extensions and lack of patent problems.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n[Use-after-free of zlib input in `png_read_end` after incomplete zTXt, iTXt\nor iCCP decompression](CVE-2026-46675)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for libpng is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of medium. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Medium",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "libpng",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
  ],
